{"ref":"BDB, שׁוּל","hw":"שׁוּל","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">שׁוּל</span>]</big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 6:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.6.1\">Is 6:1</a> <strong>skirt</strong>, of robe;—pl. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁוּלֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:34\" href=\"/Exodus.28.34\">Ex 28:34</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁוּלַיִךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 3:5\" href=\"/Nahum.3.5\">Na 3:5</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁוּלָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 6:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.6.1\">Is 6:1</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁוּלֶיהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 1:9\" href=\"/Lamentations.1.9\">La 1:9</a>;—<em>skirts;</em> of <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span>’s train, in vision <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 6:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.6.1\">Is 6:1</a>; elsewhere of city personif. as woman, in phrase of ignominy, <span dir=\"rtl\">חָשַׂפְתִּי שׁוּלַיִךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 13:26\" href=\"/Jeremiah.13.26\">Je 13:26</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גִּלֵּיתִי שׁ׳ עַל־פָּנַיִךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 3:5\" href=\"/Nahum.3.5\">Na 3:5</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">נִגְלוּ שׁ׳ וגו׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 13:22\" href=\"/Jeremiah.13.22\">Je 13:22</a>; of defilement, <span dir=\"rtl\">טֻמְאָתָהּ בְּשׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 1:9\" href=\"/Lamentations.1.9\">La 1:9</a>; of high priest’s robe <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:33\" href=\"/Exodus.28.33\">Ex 28:33</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:34\" href=\"/Exodus.28.34\">34</a> = <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:24\" href=\"/Exodus.39.24\">39:24</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:25\" href=\"/Exodus.39.25\">25</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:26\" href=\"/Exodus.39.26\">26</a> (all P).","next":"BDB, שׁוֹלָל","prev":"BDB, שׁול"}